  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll Help Guide\n\n### Changing Decimals to Hrs\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 22 May, 2024 at  2:24 PM\n\n\t\tTo change the decimals into hours, you first divide the number by 24hrs in excel then select number format, then custom then type h:mm\nI've done the first two lines on the excel attached.\n\nAlso you can use this link to check:\nhttps://www.ontheclock.com/convert-hours-minutes-to-decimal-hours.aspx\n\n\t\t xlsx  Book 1.xlsx (8.48 KB) \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
